      "docs": "Includes the React component, animation hooks, engine, 24 bundled pixel-art skins, and skin credits. Pass spriteSrc for a custom 256x128 PNG in the classic 8x4 layout and bubbleText as a string or array of thoughts. Customize paused, followCursor, sleepEnabled, bubblePlacement, and bubbleScale without remounting. Mark elements with data-oneko-zone=\"avoid\" or data-oneko-zone=\"attract\", or pass zones using selectors or viewport rectangles. Render from a client-only entry point. Sound is off by default. To enable it, copy sound files to public/cat-sounds/, set meow={true}, and optionally set soundBasePath to your sound directory. Use storageKey for independent saved positions."
